   "locked": false,
   "text": "States: empty — no edits: \"Nothing to share. Make an edit first.\" with the primary button disabled; loading — \"Sharing…\" / \"Confirming…\"; error — \"The common plan\nmoved: rebase first\" with a button to S-19; engine error with Retry; success — the visibility badge changes to \"Shared for review\" (S-14 turns read-only), or to\n\"Confirmed\" with the toast \"Confirmed into the common plan · 3 alerts sent to Operations\".",
   "originalText": "States: empty — no edits: \"Nothing to share. Make an edit first.\" with the primary button disabled; loading — \"Sharing…\" / \"Confirming…\"; error — \"The common plan\nmoved: rebase first\" with a button to S-19; engine error with Retry; success — the visibility badge changes to \"Shared for review\" (S-14 turns read-only), or to\n\"Confirmed\" with the toast \"Confirmed into the common plan · 3 alerts sent to Operations\".",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 1,
